  "root_policy": "Strip exactly each selected part payload_prefix, map payload path to restored single root. PART_INFO.json is metadata, not restored payload. Equal repeated member in same release merges once; conflicting bytes block and report, never last-writer-wins.",
  "resource_policy": "Relative HTML href/src, CSS url/import, Markdown links, and catalog href with base=root; resolve percent paths/dot segments within restored root, preserve exact case and validate HTML fragments. No network/CDN/eval.",
  "verification_policy": "Verify actual restored bytes and resource graph. Existing notes override exact/casefold path collisions; preserve release member bytes in distribution_templates/<release path>. Never regenerate missing slices or entire app.",
  "local_use": "Open results/restored/index.html as a local file; controlled original classic scripts use embedded catalog, no fetch/server/account required. If browser not actually opened, record not_run/unknown honestly rather than claiming launch.",
